          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For most home gyms, buy the REP Fitness Open Trap Bar</strong>
            with standard handles: it is open, rackable, long-sleeved and has a five-year warranty. If you
